cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LocalGovBench, please cite this research software."
type: software
title: "LocalGovBench: Public research software for AI inventory disclosure and documentary evidence availability"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-07-30"
license: MIT
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21701861"
abstract: >-
  Canonical public research-software release (v1.0.0) accompanying the submitted
  manuscript on documentary evidence availability in public AI inventories.
  Includes the frozen public-satisfiability pilot artefacts (LocalGovBench v0.1
  evidence-requirement catalogue mappings; freeze 2026-06-24), Disclosure
  Functions v1 specification and coding layers, supplements A–J, and manuscript
  paper_assets scaffolds. Does not provide governance readiness or maturity
  scores, jurisdiction rankings, or compliance scores. Historical prior deposits
  (v0.2.0 DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21500899; v0.1.0 DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20543779) are
  retained for provenance only.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - public sector
  - algorithm registers
  - AI inventories
  - algorithmic transparency
  - documentary evidence availability
  - disclosure affordance
  - schema coding
  - reproducibility
  - European Union
